  m_Name: PointOutReedAndDarry
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NewDialogueData
  npcName: Chime
  dialogueLines:
  - LineID: Start
    Speaker: Chime
    text: Look, there's Reed!
    lineTone: 0
    NPCGender: 
    NextLineID: Part II
    endDialogueAfterLine: 0
    movingOn: 0
    GiveItem: 0
    choices: []
    objectivesToActivate: []
  - LineID: Part II
    Speaker: Chime
    text: ...It looks like he's arguing with someone, do you know who that is?
    lineTone: 0
    NPCGender: 
    NextLineID: 
    endDialogueAfterLine: 0
    movingOn: 0
    GiveItem: 0
    choices:
    - text: Yeah, that's Darry.
      NextLineID: E Good I
      moralityChange: 1
      direction: 0
      objectiveToActivate: 
    - text: Dunno. Wasn't listening.
      NextLineID: E Bad I
      moralityChange: -1
      direction: 1
      objectiveToActivate: 
    objectivesToActivate: []
  - LineID: Good
    Speaker: Chime
    text: So that's the friend he was mourning in The Graveyard, you should see why
      they're arguing...
    lineTone: 0
    NPCGender: 
    NextLineID: 
    endDialogueAfterLine: 1
    movingOn: 0
    GiveItem: 0
    choices: []
    objectivesToActivate: []
  - LineID: Bad
    Speaker: Chime
    text: That's his friend he was mourning in The Graveyard, Darry. Go figure out
      why they're arguing with each other.
    lineTone: 0
    NPCGender: 
    NextLineID: 
    endDialogueAfterLine: 1
    movingOn: 0
    GiveItem: 0
    choices: []
    objectivesToActivate: []
  - LineID: E Good I
    Speaker: Echo
    text: That's Darry, his roommate that he was visiting in the graveyard. Is he
      alive again here in the Astral Plane?
    lineTone: 0
    NPCGender: female
    NextLineID: Good
    endDialogueAfterLine: 0
    movingOn: 0
    GiveItem: 0
    choices: []
    objectivesToActivate: []
  - LineID: E Bad I
    Speaker: Echo
    text: I dunno. I think he was telling me about a friend of his in the Graveyard,
      but I was fighting the urge to fall asleep.
    lineTone: 0
    NPCGender: female
    NextLineID: Bad
    endDialogueAfterLine: 0
    movingOn: 0
    GiveItem: 0
    choices: []
